    <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-10 mb-4">What is a Position Size Calculator?</h3>
    
    <p>
      A <strong>position size calculator</strong> is an essential utility that computes the exact number of units, lots, or contracts a trader should open to stay within their predefined risk parameters. When you use our calculator, you input your account balance, the percentage or exact dollar amount you are willing to risk, and your stop loss distance in pips, points, or price.
    </p>
    
    <p>
      The calculator then outputs the optimal position size. This removes all the guesswork from your trading routine, ensuring that a single losing trade will never blow your account.
    </p>

